-- Sale of Goods Act 1979 (Singapore).  LAYER 1 TESTS for the Schedule and the subsections that point at it.
-- Expected values are written from the text beside each assertion, before running.  Dates are the day before, the first day and the last day of each window.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `soga-nouns`
IMPORT `soga-part2-formation`
IMPORT `soga-part7-supplementary`
IMPORT `soga-schedule`

#ASSERT `helper (Schedule): the date falls within the window` (Date 17 5 1973) (Date 18 5 1973) (Date 1 2 1978) EQUALS FALSE
