-- paragraph 1(2).
#ASSERT `sch para 1(2) what a reference in the Schedule refers to` `a reference to a section` EQUALS JUST `a section of this Act`
#ASSERT `sch para 1(2) what a reference in the Schedule refers to` `a reference to a contract` EQUALS JUST `a contract of sale of goods`
#ASSERT `sch para 1(2) what a reference in the Schedule refers to` `a reference to anything else` EQUALS NOTHING -- the paragraph speaks only of sections and contracts
#ASSERT `sch para 1(3) the Schedule affects the contract` (Date 31 12 1893) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- the text says no
#ASSERT `sch para 1(3) the Schedule affects the contract` (Date 1 1 1894) EQUALS NOTHING -- on 1 Jan 1894
